cuems-common (1.1.0-3) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * cuems-controller-engine.service: add LD_LIBRARY_PATH pointing to the
    python_rtmidi-bundled libjack. Without it, the controller-engine's
    MtcListener fails to import rtmidi (libjack-<hash>.so.0.1.0 cannot
    be opened) and no MTC timecode reaches the UI. The equivalent
    Environment= line was already present on cuems-node-engine.service.

 -- Ion Reguera <ion@stagelab.coop>  Thu, 16 Apr 2026 21:25:00 +0200

cuems-common (1.1.0-2) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * debian/install: drop shipping of hostapd.service. That file is owned
    by the upstream hostapd package; shipping it here causes dpkg -i to
    fail with "trying to overwrite '/lib/systemd/system/hostapd.service'".
    CUEMS customisation of hostapd's behaviour happens via the
    hostapd.service.d/* dropin directory, which is kept.

 -- Ion Reguera <ion@stagelab.coop>  Thu, 16 Apr 2026 21:05:00 +0200

cuems-common (1.1.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * merge rc_1 into debian/bookworm (48 commits): brings in accumulated
    rc_1 work onto the release branch
    - cuems-node-engine.service: update pkill patterns for the player
      binary rename (audioplayer-cuems -> cuems-audioplayer, and
      dmxplayer-cuems -> cuems-dmxplayer)
    - plus accumulated OLA daemon configuration, systemd dependency
      hardening, user-facing script relocation to /usr/bin, and other
      packaging fixes from rc_1
  * debian/install: drop duplicate cuems-controller-engine.service and
    duplicate hostapd.service.d/* entries (merge-conflict leftovers)
  * debian/postinst: add missing fi closing the
    "Disabled unnecessary systemd services/timers" block

 -- Ion Reguera <ion@stagelab.coop>  Thu, 16 Apr 2026 20:45:00 +0200

cuems-common (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * CUEMS common configuration and systemd services
  * All Python scripts use /usr/lib/cuems/bin/python3 from cuems-utils
  * Wayland support via cuems-wayland.service
  * WiFi access point support via hostapd and isc-dhcp-server

